<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Action Potentials — Teach the Teacher</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&family=Outfit:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #0a0e1a;
    --surface: #111827;
    --card: #1a2235;
    --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    --accent-sk: #00e5ff;
    --accent-nv: #a78bfa;
    --accent-pk: #f472b6;
    --text: #f0f4ff;
    --muted: #8892aa;
    --green: #34d399;
    --red: #f87171;
    --yellow: #fbbf24;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body {
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    min-height: 100vh;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  /* ── SCREENS ── */
  .screen { display: none; min-height: 100vh; }
  .screen.active { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }

  /* ── SPLASH ── */
  #splash {
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, rgba(0,229,255,0.08) 0%, transparent 60%),
                radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 80%, rgba(167,139,250,0.08) 0%, transparent 50%),
                var(--bg);
  }
  .splash-icon { font-size: 4rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .splash-title {
    font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5vw, 3.2rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .splash-title span { color: var(--accent-sk); }
  .splash-sub { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 2.5rem; max-width: 480px; }
  .topic-pills { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
  .pill {
    padding: 0.5rem 1.2rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    cursor: default;
  }
  .pill.sk { background: rgba(0,229,255,0.12); color: var(--accent-sk); border: 1px solid rgba(0,229,255,0.3); }
  .pill.nv { background: rgba(167,139,250,0.12); color: var(--accent-nv); border: 1px solid rgba(167,139,250,0.3); }
  .pill.pk { background: rgba(244,114,182,0.12); color: var(--accent-pk); border: 1px solid rgba(244,114,182,0.3); }
  .btn-start {
    background: var(--accent-sk);
    color: #000;
    border: none;
    padding: 0.9rem 2.8rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    transition: transform 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;
    box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(0,229,255,0.35);
  }
  .btn-start:hover { transform: scale(1.04); box-shadow: 0 0 36px rgba(0,229,255,0.5); }

  /* ── TOPIC NAV ── */
  #topics {
    padding: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
  }
  .topic-nav {
    display: flex;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--surface);
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 50;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .tab {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 1rem 0.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--muted);
    cursor: pointer;
    border-bottom: 3px solid transparent;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    white-space: nowrap;
    min-width: 90px;
  }
  .tab:hover { color: var(--text); }
  .tab.active-tab { color: var(--text); }
  .tab.sk.active-tab { border-bottom-color: var(--accent-sk); color: var(--accent-sk); }
  .tab.nv.active-tab { border-bottom-color: var(--accent-nv); color: var(--accent-nv); }
  .tab.pk.active-tab { border-bottom-color: var(--accent-pk); color: var(--accent-pk); }
  .tab.bp.active-tab { border-bottom-color: var(--yellow); color: var(--yellow); }
  .tab.quiz-tab.active-tab { border-bottom-color: var(--yellow); color: var(--yellow); }

  .topic-content { display: none; padding: 2rem 1.5rem; max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .topic-content.visible { display: block; }

  /* ── SECTION HEADERS ── */
  .section-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.9rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .section-badge.sk { background: rgba(0,229,255,0.12); color: var(--accent-sk); }
  .section-badge.nv { background: rgba(167,139,250,0.12); color: var(--accent-nv); }
  .section-badge.pk { background: rgba(244,114,182,0.12); color: var(--accent-pk); }

  h2.topic-title { font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2rem); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .topic-intro { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; line-height: 1.6; }

  /* ── PHASES ── */
  .phases-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .phase-card {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    border-left: 3px solid transparent;
  }
  .phase-card:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); }
  .phase-card.selected { border-left-color: var(--accent); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); }
  .phase-num { font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .phase-name { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .phase-mv { font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--muted); }
  .phase-detail { margin-top: 0.6rem; font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.5; display: none; }
  .phase-card.selected .phase-detail { display: block; }
  .phase-card.selected .phase-mv { color: var(--accent); }

  /* ── WAVEFORM ── */
  .waveform-box {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .waveform-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }
  canvas.waveform { width: 100%; height: 140px; display: block; border-radius: 8px; }

  /* ── ION TABLE ── */
  .ion-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 2rem; font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .ion-table th { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; text-align: left; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .ion-table td { padding: 0.7rem 0.8rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04); }
  .ion-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
  .tag { display: inline-block; padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .tag.in { background: rgba(52,211,153,0.15); color: var(--green); }
  .tag.out { background: rgba(248,113,113,0.15); color: var(--red); }
  .tag.slow { background: rgba(251,191,36,0.1); color: var(--yellow); }

  /* ── KEY FACTS ── */
  .key-facts { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(140px, 1fr)); gap: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .fact-card { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 1rem; text-align: center; }
  .fact-value { font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace; font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .fact-label { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 0.2rem; }

  /* ── COMPARE ── */
  .compare-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .compare-col { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.1rem; }
  .compare-head { font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; padding-bottom: 0.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .compare-head.sk { color: var(--accent-sk); }
  .compare-head.nv { color: var(--accent-nv); }
  .compare-head.pk { color: var(--accent-pk); }
  .compare-row { font-size: 0.8rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; line-height: 1.4; }
  .compare-row span { display: block; font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--muted); }

  /* ── QUIZ ── */
  #quiz-content { padding: 2rem 1.5rem; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .quiz-progress { display: flex; gap: 0.4rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .q-dot { flex: 1; height: 4px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--border); transition: background 0.3s; }
  .q-dot.done { background: var(--green); }
  .q-dot.current { background: var(--yellow); }

  .quiz-card {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 1.8rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .q-meta { font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .q-text { font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .q-options { display: grid; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .q-opt {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.1rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    transition: all 0.18s;
  }
  .q-opt:hover:not(.disabled) { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); }
  .q-opt.correct { background: rgba(52,211,153,0.1); border-color: var(--green); }
  .q-opt.wrong { background: rgba(248,113,113,0.1); border-color: var(--red); }
  .q-opt.disabled { cursor: default; }
  .opt-letter {
    width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .q-opt.correct .opt-letter { background: var(--green); color: #000; }
  .q-opt.wrong .opt-letter { background: var(--red); color: #fff; }

  .q-explain {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.1rem;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    display: none;
  }
  .q-explain.show { display: block; }
  .q-explain.right { background: rgba(52,211,153,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(52,211,153,0.2); color: var(--green); }
  .q-explain.wrong { background: rgba(248,113,113,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(248,113,113,0.2); color: #fca5a5; }

  .btn-next {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text);
    padding: 0.75rem 1.8rem;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.18s;
    display: none;
  }
  .btn-next.show { display: inline-block; }
  .btn-next:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); }

  /* ── SCORE ── */
  #score-screen {
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }
  .score-ring {
    width: 140px; height: 140px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
    font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
  }
  .score-num { font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .score-denom { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--muted); }
  .score-msg { font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .score-sub { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .btn-retry {
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text);
    padding: 0.75rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    margin-right: 0.75rem;
    transition: all 0.18s;
  }
  .btn-retry:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); }
  .btn-review {
    background: var(--yellow);
    color: #000;
    border: none;
    padding: 0.75rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.18s;
  }
  .btn-review:hover { opacity: 0.9; }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .compare-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .phases-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .key-facts { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  }

  /* ── PERFECT SCORE GIFT ── */
  #gift-overlay {
    display: none;
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 999;
    background: #000;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  #gift-overlay.show { display: flex; }

  #gift-canvas {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .gift-inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem;
    max-width: 600px;
    animation: giftFadeIn 0.8s ease 0.3s both;
  }
  @keyframes giftFadeIn {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); }
    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  .gift-flatline {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 500px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
    display: block;
  }

  .cert-box {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0d1b2a 0%, #0a1628 100%);
    border: 2px solid #00e5ff;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 2rem 2rem 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 0 60px rgba(0,229,255,0.2), inset 0 0 40px rgba(0,229,255,0.03);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .cert-box::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -1px; left: 10%; right: 10%;
    height: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #00e5ff, transparent);
  }
  .cert-corner {
    position: absolute;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }
  .cert-corner.tl { top: 10px; left: 14px; }
  .cert-corner.tr { top: 10px; right: 14px; }
  .cert-corner.bl { bottom: 10px; left: 14px; }
  .cert-corner.br { bottom: 10px; right: 14px; }

  .cert-title {
    font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: #00e5ff;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .cert-headline {
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 4vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff 30%, #00e5ff);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }
  .cert-body {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: #8892aa;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
  }
  .cert-body strong { color: #fff; -webkit-text-fill-color: #fff; }
  .cert-secret {
    font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: #00e5ff;
    background: rgba(0,229,255,0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0,229,255,0.2);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .cert-secret .label {
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    color: #4ecdc4;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }
  .cert-sig {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: rgba(136,146,170,0.5);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    padding-top: 1rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .gift-btn-row { display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn-gift-close {
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    color: #8892aa;
    padding: 0.7rem 1.6rem;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.18s;
  }
  .btn-gift-close:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #fff; }
  .pulse-text {
    animation: pulseGlow 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes pulseGlow {
    0%,100% { text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0,229,255,0.4); }
    50%      { text-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(0,229,255,0.9), 0 0 48px rgba(0,229,255,0.3); }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- SPLASH -->
<div id="splash" class="screen active">
  <div class="splash-icon">⚡</div>
  <h1 class="splash-title">Action <span>Potentials</span></h1>
  <p class="splash-sub">An interactive "Teach the Teacher" module for Algonquin College paramedic students</p>
  <div class="topic-pills">
    <div class="pill sk">⚡ Skeletal Muscle</div>
    <div class="pill nv">🧠 Nervous System</div>
    <div class="pill pk">💓 Pacemaker</div>
  </div>
  <button class="btn-start" onclick="goTopics()">Start Learning →</button>
</div>

<!-- TOPICS SCREEN -->
<div id="topics" class="screen">
  <nav class="topic-nav">
    <div class="tab bp active-tab" onclick="showTab('bp')">💡 Big Picture</div>
    <div class="tab sk" onclick="showTab('sk')">⚡ Skeletal</div>
    <div class="tab nv" onclick="showTab('nv')">🧠 Nervous</div>
    <div class="tab pk" onclick="showTab('pk')">💓 Cardiac</div>
    <div class="tab quiz-tab" onclick="showTab('quiz')">🎯 Quiz</div>
  </nav>

  <!-- BIG PICTURE -->
  <div id="tab-bp" class="topic-content visible">
    <div class="section-badge" style="background:rgba(251,191,36,0.1);color:var(--yellow);">Big Picture</div>
    <h2 class="topic-title">What is an Action Potential?</h2>
    <p class="topic-intro">Before diving into each tissue type, let's establish the foundation that ties everything together.</p>

    <div style="background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:1.3rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
      <div style="font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--yellow);margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Definition</div>
      <p style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:0.6rem;">A rapid, temporary change in membrane potential used as an electrical signal for communication.</p>
      <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;">The cell membrane sits at a negative resting potential. When a threshold stimulus arrives, ion channels open and the membrane briefly reverses polarity — then rapidly restores itself.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="key-facts" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
      <div class="fact-card"><div class="fact-value" style="color:var(--yellow);font-size:0.95rem;">Depolarization</div><div class="fact-label">Na⁺ rushes in → membrane goes positive</div></div>
      <div class="fact-card"><div class="fact-value" style="color:var(--yellow);font-size:0.95rem;">Repolarization</div><div class="fact-label">K⁺ rushes out → membrane returns negative</div></div>
    </div>

    <div style="background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:1.3rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
      <div style="font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--yellow);margin-bottom:0.75rem;">The Big Transition</div>
      <p style="font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:1rem;">Even though the <strong style="color:var(--text);">mechanism is similar</strong> — threshold, depolarization, repolarization — the <strong style="color:var(--text);">purpose and behavior</strong> of APs changes dramatically depending on the tissue.</p>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(140px,1fr));gap:0.75rem;">
        <div style="text-align:center;padding:0.9rem;background:rgba(167,139,250,0.06);border:1px solid rgba(167,139,250,0.2);border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer;" onclick="showTab('nv')">
          <div style="font-size:1.4rem;margin-bottom:0.3rem;">🧠</div>
          <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--accent-nv);font-size:0.85rem;margin-bottom:0.2rem;">Nervous</div>
          <div style="font-size:0.72rem;color:var(--muted);">Speed & precision</div>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align:center;padding:0.9rem;background:rgba(0,229,255,0.06);border:1px solid rgba(0,229,255,0.2);border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer;" onclick="showTab('sk')">
          <div style="font-size:1.4rem;margin-bottom:0.3rem;">⚡</div>
